<title>AUSTRIA: Flughafen Wien '96 passenger numbers up.</title>
<headline>Flughafen Wien '96 passenger numbers up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vienna airport operator Flughafen Wien said on Thursday 1996 passenger numbers rose to 9.14 million, up seven percent from the year before.</p>
<p>Passenger numbers on scheduled flights were up 6.8 percent at 7.65 million, while charter passengers rose 7.9 percent to 1.48 million. The number of takeoffs and landings increased 7.7 percent to 154.912, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
